  "artifact_text": "**Observations**\n- Pod `notifications-worker-6784d8b8df-lk5l8` terminated with exit code 1 (`Error`) in `pod/notifications-worker-6784d8b8df-lk5l8` status.\n- Pod logs reported `ERROR notifications-worker: missing required setting SMTP_PASSWORD (environment variable is unset or empty)`.\n- Deployment log entry `CI-2459` shows release `v2.0.0` changed configuration to require environment variables instead of config files.\n\n**Ruled-Out Leads**\n- Memory exhaustion was ruled out because the container status indicates exit code 1 (`Error`) rather than `OOMKilled`.\n- Probe failure causing restarts was ruled out because the process exits immediately at startup before liveness probe failures occur.\n\n**Root Cause**\nDeployment `CI-2459` introduced a requirement for `SMTP_PASSWORD`, but optional Secret key `SMTP_PASSWORD` from Secret `notifications-smtp` was unset.\n\n**Recommended Action**\nThe notifications team should populate key `SMTP_PASSWORD` in Secret `notifications-smtp` or roll back Deployment `notifications-worker` per runbook `RB-010`.",
